WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.458
Materialization is useful when an expensive result
is read repeatedly and consumers can tolerate a

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:11.294
known refresh lag The database object alone is not
the whole design

00:00:13.051 --> 00:00:20.248
You also need a refresh schedule freshness metadata
and a plan for refresh failures Without

00:00:20.274 --> 00:00:23.484
those consumers may not know how current the
snapshot is
